SUMMARY:Early Modern Philosophy Research Interest Group (Andreea Mihali\, Wilfrid Laurier)
DESCRIPTION:The Early Modern Philosophy Research Interest Group is pleased to welcome as its guest speaker Andreea Mihali (Wilfrid Laurier University) who is an expert in critical thinking\, informal logic and argumentation theory\, modern philosophy (Descartes to Kant) and visual and musical arguments. \nTalk Title\nTBD \nTalk Abstract\nTBD
